WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.160
You qualified to do the work,

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.880
not to fill in the same forms for the fifth agency in

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.020
the same month.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.560
Your DBS, your registration,

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.020
your right to work, your training certificates,

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.340
sent again and again to people

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.280
who will ask for them again next year.

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.290
Qura is built the other way round.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.430
One registration filled in once and it stays yours.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:31.450
Then we check it.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.970
Registered means you gave us your registration number.

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:39.190
Verified means a person opened the official public register

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:40.530
and confirmed it.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.570
Those are different words here and they always will be.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.460
Because that check is the only reason a hospital should

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:52.020
trust what it sees, and it is the reason the work comes

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.300
to you instead of you going looking for it.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.780
We open on 22 September.

00:00:58.280 --> 00:01:00.440
Join now, get verified now,

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.120
and be in front of hospitals and workforce suppliers

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.380
from the first morning.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:05.940
Joining is free.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:06.960
Qura.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.060
Connect.

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:09.200
Engage.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.400
Win.

